<title>USA: Four Media to buy Anderson Film.</title>
<headline>Four Media to buy Anderson Film.</headline>
<dateline>BURBANK, Calif. 1997-02-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Four Media Co said it reached an agreement to acquire Anderson Film Industries Corp.</p>
<p>Anderson, based in Universal City, California, provides technical and creative service to feature film studios and to producers of television programming.</p>
